// 下转到泛型子类的实例化（`(Sub<string>)baseRef`）在运行期核对类型实参：实参不符抛
// InvalidCastException，相符照常通过。
namespace Demo;

using Std;

class Base { }
class Sub<T> : Base { public T V; }

void Main() {
    Base b = new Sub<int>();
    bool threw = false;
    try { Sub<string> s = (Sub<string>)b; } catch (InvalidCastException e) { threw = true; }
    Assert.True(threw);
    Assert.True((b as Sub<string>) == null);

    Sub<int> si = (Sub<int>)b;
    si.V = 5;
    Assert.Equal(5, si.V);
    Assert.True((b as Sub<int>) != null);
}
